  ('1780C611-C6F8-5583-990E-5CD23359CBA6', '38A94C6E-7A36-5060-A0BC-1CB044163169', N'User', N'Which members look at risk of not renewing this cycle?', N'Complete', 0, 0, 0, '44128A76-18CC-5CCF-B207-4FB90C283EF5', '2026-07-25T00:00:00Z', '2026-07-25T00:00:00Z'),
  ('1D6DDD86-F0EF-543B-AD86-8DAC45B2CE5D', '38A94C6E-7A36-5060-A0BC-1CB044163169', N'AI', N'Looking across renewal status, satisfaction and open support items: 50 memberships are pending renewal right now, and 159 lapsed during 2025. The clearest individual risk signal is Bob Kowalski — declining survey scores across three conferences, reduced event participation, and an open billing dispute that also has an unanswered secure-message thread. I''d prioritize resolving the billing issue before the renewal conversation.', N'Complete', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25T00:03:00Z', '2026-07-25T00:03:00Z'),
  ('25D09FEC-B536-545D-88C7-617B9B9A8998', '38A94C6E-7A36-5060-A0BC-1CB044163169', N'User', N'What about billing issues generally — how many are open?', N'Complete', 0, 0, 0, '44128A76-18CC-5CCF-B207-4FB90C283EF5', '2026-07-25T00:08:00Z', '2026-07-25T00:08:00Z'),
  ('0B5A1E7F-5173-550D-836C-4A67DAE13877', '38A94C6E-7A36-5060-A0BC-1CB044163169', N'AI', N'There are 5 open billing issues. Members with an unresolved billing dispute at renewal time lapse at a visibly higher rate in this dataset, so the open ones are worth triaging this week.', N'Complete', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25T00:11:00Z', '2026-07-25T00:11:00Z'),
  ('6D41AEE4-580F-56DF-B9EC-DBF0BBFCA729', '9707CA4B-8D35-56AE-9677-B32DC8431C30', N'User', N'Give me a quick read on the membership base composition.', N'Complete', 0, 0, 0, 'C6309AFC-F5DE-5794-8865-FC99D5DD82F4', '2026-07-18T00:00:00Z', '2026-07-18T00:00:00Z'),
  ('3A33C1AA-029C-5C85-831A-28A007978C37', '9707CA4B-8D35-56AE-9677-B32DC8431C30', N'AI', N'The federation currently has 2109 member profiles. The largest segment is Producer with 843 members. I saved the full segment-by-region breakdown as the reusable query "Members by segment and region" if you want the complete table.', N'Complete', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '2026-07-18T00:06:00Z', '2026-07-18T00:06:00Z'),
  ('15C00668-92EF-5AFB-B186-7EB87DB0BA4F', '97EB074C-F2CC-50EB-BA47-1930E3A587C6', N'User', N'How did attendance look for the most recent annual conference?', N'Complete', 0, 0, 0, 'DB3FBC6B-D6D0-5095-B988-DDF0F9D80DCD', '2026-07-11T00:00:00Z', '2026-07-11T00:00:00Z'),
